{"skill":{"slug":"multi-search-engine-2-0-1","displayName":"Multi Search Engine 2.0.1"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772543153534,"changelog":"- Initial release of multi-search-engine v2.0.1.\n- Integrates 17 search engines: 8 domestic (China) and 9 international/global.\n- Supports advanced search operators (site, filetype, quotes, exclude, OR) and time filters.\n- Adds privacy-focused search engines (DuckDuckGo, Startpage, Brave, Qwant).\n- Enables use of DuckDuckGo bangs and WolframAlpha knowledge queries.\n- No API keys required for any engine.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","size":376,"sha256":"21ed06de8dcb14e477f44b6cc7762e18689c4b2da0006600c9d5a509a32bb17c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"CHANNELLOG.md","size":1132,"sha256":"e76603f4891c4deb7d81dfb8966218a3705d639bf1f721bccb1626d4fd1aa67e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3372,"sha256":"ef2d2706e82ad0fc8d681b48e08cfac3ddb716972560394dabe25bf01ccf4933","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"_meta.json","size":138,"sha256":"c519005e390529c64cea5e920e579f2c840dfa6fe3c51d01a752f7cd3a469830","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"config.json","size":1701,"sha256":"120f98289429b9763f548266d65a48faf4d50acb39d893260386cf3c5f370d25","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"metadata.json","size":239,"sha256":"2199f8bbabb0014745ab8c20bcc37906e6e5f431aea59196348af88b9582cad8","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/international-search.md","size":23161,"sha256":"ee2d742aa59287140b388ca10ab2c9cb7da9c5d86a2b2a991ea06a79916ed390","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2011,"sha256":"90e9a1b063a7e3e2793af8769525a3aa46e3c91743d1f680548124b5e6af66f6","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789099990178,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"c6def92a89420f5dacf9c6e797c13547557143cd7aa5dd726c92952808ed50f5","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/c6def92a89420f5dacf9c6e797c13547557143cd7aa5dd726c92952808ed50f5","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085633575},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":50,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":6,"checkedAt":1789099990178},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed search-helper skill that builds third-party search URLs, with privacy and content-safety caveats but no hidden execution, persistence, or credential handling.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The requested environment use is proportionate to a search skill: outbound requests to user-selected search URLs. It does not request local filesystem, credential, profile, or account access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains Markdown and JSON only, with no executable scripts, dependency installation, remote payload retrieval, or install-time commands.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are mostly documentation and web_fetch examples. Search terms are sent to external search providers by design; this is visible from the URLs, though the main skill would benefit from a clearer privacy warning.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background worker, scheduled task, memory modification, privilege escalation, or tool wrapping behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The capabilities match the stated purpose: URL templates and examples for multiple search engines, advanced operators, time filters, DuckDuckGo bangs, and WolframAlpha queries. Some examples are dual-use, such as searching for password text or login pages, but they are presented as search operators rather than exploitation steps.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with your search queries being sent to the selected third-party search engine. Do not use it for secrets, credentials, private internal names, sensitive personal data, or searches that would violate law or policy; be cautious with safe-search-off options and dual-use advanced operators.","findings":"[AE1] unexpected: The referenced international guide is present and was fully inspected here; the separate missing advanced-search reference appears to be a documentation completeness issue, not evidence of hidden behavior.\n[SQP-2] expected: Third-party query transmission is inherent to a multi-search-engine helper and is visible in the URL templates, but users should avoid sending secrets, private project names, personal data, or regulated content as search terms.\n[SQP-2] expected: The DuckDuckGo safe-search disabling parameter is documented as an option, not automatically used; it should be treated as an informed user choice because it can return explicit or disturbing results.\n[SQP-2] expected: The Tor privacy suggestion is advisory text only and does not cause network changes; users should follow local law and organizational policy before using Tor.\n[SQP-3] expected: Chinese-language documentation and CN search providers are consistent with the stated CN plus global search scope, and the main SKILL.md also describes the skill in English.\n[SQP-3] expected: The CN and global engine split is disclosed in SKILL.md and config.json rather than hidden locale routing.\n[AIG-SARIF] expected: The static SARIF scan reported no T01-T09 findings.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789099990178}}}}}